1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Cheese App 上线日
Launch day for the Cheese App.

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:03,925
上周它还跑在一台笔记本上
Last week it ran on a laptop.

3
00:00:04,245 --> 00:00:08,064
今天早上它跑在云上，在一个私有网络里面
This morning it runs in the cloud, inside a private network.

4
00:00:08,384 --> 00:00:10,688
不到一个小时，三个告警响了
Within an hour, three alarms go off.

5
00:00:10,933 --> 00:00:12,312
第一个告警
First alarm.

6
00:00:12,362 --> 00:00:15,946
调用外部语言模型的聊天回答都超时了
Chat answers that call an outside language model time out.

7
00:00:16,266 --> 00:00:20,299
可是从数据库读出的聊天记录，照常加载
Yet the saved chat history, read from the database, loads fine.

8
00:00:21,033 --> 00:00:22,434
第二个告警
Second alarm.

9
00:00:22,484 --> 00:00:26,366
页面对每个访客都能加载，但 Predict 按钮失败了
The page loads for every visitor, but the Predict button fails.

10
00:00:26,686 --> 00:00:29,673
在开发者的笔记本上，同一个按钮是好的
On the developer's laptop, the same button worked.

11
00:00:30,417 --> 00:00:31,732
第三个告警
Third alarm.

12
00:00:31,782 --> 00:00:36,262
早上 9 点流量翻倍，自动扩缩器加了副本
At 9 in the morning traffic doubles, and the autoscaler adds replicas.

13
00:00:36,582 --> 00:00:39,222
最新的几个副本报 too many connections 失败了
The newest ones fail with too many connections,

14
00:00:39,222 --> 00:00:41,019
而它们的 CPU 闲着
while their processors sit idle.

15
00:00:41,867 --> 00:00:44,555
还有一个没人注意到的隐患
And one problem nobody has noticed yet.

16
00:00:44,875 --> 00:00:48,331
生产环境的密钥就放在 container image 里面
The production key is sitting inside the container image.

17
00:00:48,567 --> 00:00:52,599
每个告警都对应第 10 讲和第 16 讲里的一个机制
Each alarm is one mechanism from Lectures 10 and 16.

18
00:00:52,919 --> 00:00:56,586
我们从地址，到路由和 NAT，到浏览器
We go from addresses, to routes and NAT, to the browser,

19
00:00:56,586 --> 00:01:00,449
到配置，到容量，最后到数据库
to configuration, to capacity, and finally to the database.

20
00:01:00,683 --> 00:01:04,758
右上角的灰色标签，标出每个概念背后的课件
The gray tag, top right, names the slides behind each idea.

21
00:01:05,078 --> 00:01:06,763
这里没有任何现场运行
Nothing here is a live run.

22
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,600
先从笔记本说起
Start on the laptop.

23
00:01:09,664 --> 00:01:16,422
在课程的应用里，uvicorn 在 container 里启动 FastAPI
In the course app, uvicorn starts FastAPI inside a container,

24
00:01:16,422 --> 00:01:19,413
host 是 0.0.0.0，port 是 9000
on host 0.0.0.0, port 9000.

25
00:01:19,733 --> 00:01:22,357
这个 host 的意思是：在所有网络接口上监听
That host means listen on every interface.

26
00:01:22,677 --> 00:01:30,080
要是绑定到 127.0.0.1，它就只会回应 container 里面的请求
Bound to 127.0.0.1 instead, it would answer only from inside the container.

27
00:01:30,817 --> 00:01:33,868
这个 container 是封起来的，直到你发布一个 port
The container is sealed off until you publish a port.

28
00:01:34,188 --> 00:01:35,688
这个 -p 9000:9000
-p 9000:9000

29
00:01:35,688 --> 00:01:40,310
就是从笔记本的门通进 container 那扇门的隧道
is the tunnel from the laptop's door into the container's.

30
00:01:40,950 --> 00:01:45,943
所以 README 写着，应用在 localhost:3200 提供服务
So the README says the app is served at localhost:3200,

31
00:01:45,943 --> 00:01:49,483
并调用 localhost:9000 上的 API
and it calls the API at localhost:9000.

32
00:01:49,803 --> 00:01:53,921
所谓 localhost，永远指这台机器：代码运行的那一台
Localhost always means this machine: the one the code runs on.

33
00:01:54,167 --> 00:01:58,284
IP 地址选的是机器，port 选的是机器上的服务
An IP address picks the machine, and a port picks the service on it.

34
00:01:58,604 --> 00:02:04,626
以 10、192.168
Addresses that start with 10, with 192.168,

35
00:02:04,626 --> 00:02:10,508
或者 172.16 到 172.31 开头的地址，都是私有地址
or with 172.16 through 172.31 are private.

36
00:02:10,828 --> 00:02:12,705
互联网不会路由它们
The internet does not route them.

37
00:02:12,950 --> 00:02:15,126
把同一个 container 搬到云上
Move the same container into the cloud.

38
00:02:15,446 --> 00:02:20,630
在私有网络里，它的地址是 10.0.2.5
Inside the private network it gets the address 10.0.2.5.

39
00:02:20,950 --> 00:02:26,582
来自互联网的数据包到不了它：外面谁都没有通往私有地址的路由
A packet from the internet cannot reach it: nobody out there has a route to a private address.

40
00:02:26,817 --> 00:02:28,630
第 10 讲把它总结了一下
Lecture 10 sums it up.

41
00:02:28,950 --> 00:02:31,617
在笔记本上，你的路由器把外界挡在外面
On the laptop, your router keeps the world out.

42
00:02:31,937 --> 00:02:35,271
在云上，外界通过域名找到你
In the cloud, the public finds you by a DNS name,

43
00:02:35,271 --> 00:02:39,489
防火墙一开始是关着的，负载均衡器把流量放进来
a firewall starts closed, and a load balancer lets traffic in.

44
00:02:39,733 --> 00:02:43,335
浏览器向解析器查询 api.example.com
The browser asks a resolver for api.example.com,

45
00:02:43,335 --> 00:02:50,165
解析器再问权威 DNS，负载均衡器的公网地址就返回来了
the resolver asks the authoritative DNS, and the load balancer's public address comes back.

46
00:02:50,485 --> 00:02:55,008
然后浏览器连到负载均衡器的 port 443
Then the browser connects to the load balancer on port 443.

47
00:02:55,250 --> 00:02:58,712
负载均衡器终止 HTTPS 连接
The load balancer ends the HTTPS connection

48
00:02:58,712 --> 00:03:02,738
再向任务的 port 8000 发出自己的请求
and sends its own request to the task's port 8000.

49
00:03:03,058 --> 00:03:08,221
在那里，安全组只允许负载均衡器访问 port 8000
There, a security group allows only the load balancer, on port 8000.

50
00:03:08,541 --> 00:03:10,257
陌生人的数据包会被挡回去
A stranger's packet bounces,

51
00:03:10,257 --> 00:03:14,855
而回复能出去，因为防火墙记得这条连接
and the reply goes back out, because the firewall remembers the connection.

52
00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:18,769
SSH 连到机器，而客户端连到服务
SSH reaches the machine, while clients reach the service.

53
00:03:19,089 --> 00:03:21,073
课上画的是 Amazon 的名字
The lecture draws Amazon names.

54
00:03:21,393 --> 00:03:23,286
在 Google Cloud 上，对应的是
On Google Cloud the neighbors

55
00:03:23,286 --> 00:03:26,876
Compute Engine、Cloud Load Balancing 和 Cloud NAT
are Compute Engine, Cloud Load Balancing and Cloud NAT.

56
00:03:27,117 --> 00:03:31,277
题目里出现 localhost，就想：代码运行的那台机器
If the question says localhost, think: the machine the code runs on.

57
00:03:31,597 --> 00:03:35,458
10 开头的地址：私有的，从互联网上到不了
A 10.x address: private, unreachable from the internet.

58
00:03:35,778 --> 00:03:40,686
公网客户端：域名，port 443 上的负载均衡器
Public clients: a DNS name, the load balancer on 443,

59
00:03:40,686 --> 00:03:43,650
再到 port 8000 上的私有目标
then the private target on 8000.

60
00:03:45,783 --> 00:03:50,946
现在看第一个告警：语言模型超时，但数据库有回应
Now the first alarm: the language model times out, but the database answers.

61
00:03:51,266 --> 00:03:58,071
一个 VPC 就是一整块地址，这里是 10.0.0.0/16
A VPC is one block of addresses, here 10.0.0.0/16.

62
00:03:58,391 --> 00:04:01,122
斜杠后面的数，是 32 位里固定的位数
The slash counts the fixed bits out of 32.

63
00:04:01,442 --> 00:04:08,098
写 /16，就留下 16 位可变：65536 个地址
/16 leaves 16 bits to vary: 65,536 addresses.

64
00:04:08,418 --> 00:04:11,724
写 /24，就留下 8 位：256 个
/24 leaves 8: 256.

65
00:04:11,966 --> 00:04:14,313
课上把它切成三个子网
The lecture cuts it into three subnets.

66
00:04:14,633 --> 00:04:16,787
一个公有子网，放负载均衡器
A public one for the load balancer.

67
00:04:17,107 --> 00:04:20,201
一个私有应用子网，放 FastAPI 任务
A private app subnet for the FastAPI tasks.

68
00:04:20,521 --> 00:04:22,974
一个私有数据子网，放数据库
A private data subnet for the database.

69
00:04:23,216 --> 00:04:25,243
每个子网都有一张路由表
Every subnet has a route table.

70
00:04:25,563 --> 00:04:28,677
两张表都把 VPC 自己的地址块交给 local 路由
Both send the VPC's own block to the local route.

71
00:04:28,997 --> 00:04:35,013
唯一的区别是默认那一行，0.0.0.0/0
The only difference is the default row, 0.0.0.0/0.

72
00:04:35,333 --> 00:04:38,285
公有子网把它发给 Internet Gateway
A public subnet sends it to the Internet Gateway,

73
00:04:38,285 --> 00:04:40,454
私有子网发给 NAT Gateway
a private subnet to the NAT Gateway.

74
00:04:40,700 --> 00:04:43,708
光有路由还不够，课件第 13 页补充说
A route alone is not enough, slide 13 adds:

75
00:04:43,708 --> 00:04:47,974
机器还需要公网地址和打开的防火墙
the machine also needs a public address and an open firewall.

76
00:04:48,216 --> 00:04:53,842
发往 10.0.3.7 上数据库的数据包，两行都匹配
A packet for the database at 10.0.3.7 matches both rows,

77
00:04:53,842 --> 00:04:58,563
而最具体的那条匹配胜出：/16 胜过 /0
and the most specific match wins: /16 beats /0.

78
00:04:58,883 --> 00:05:01,699
这个数据包留在里面，走 local 路由
The packet stays inside, on the local route.

79
00:05:02,433 --> 00:05:06,987
发往语言模型 API 的数据包只匹配默认那一行
A packet for the language model API matches only the default row,

80
00:05:06,987 --> 00:05:09,089
所以它去了 NAT Gateway
so it goes to the NAT Gateway.

81
00:05:09,409 --> 00:05:12,910
NAT 把私有的源地址改写成自己的公网地址
NAT rewrites the private source to its own public address,

82
00:05:12,910 --> 00:05:16,108
把映射记在小本子上，再发出去
writes the mapping in its notebook, and sends it out.

83
00:05:17,083 --> 00:05:21,072
回复回来了，NAT 找到那一行，把它交给任务
The reply comes back, NAT finds the line, and hands it to the task.

84
00:05:21,392 --> 00:05:25,062
没人请求过的数据包没有对应的那一行，所以直接丢弃
A packet nobody asked for has no line, so it is dropped.

85
00:05:25,382 --> 00:05:28,240
NAT 只转发从里面发起的连接
NAT only carries connections that start inside.

86
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:32,699
不请自来的一律进不来，私有子网也就保持私有
Nothing uninvited gets in, which keeps the private subnet private.

87
00:05:32,933 --> 00:05:34,462
现在 NAT 坏了
Now NAT fails.

88
00:05:34,512 --> 00:05:37,178
每个访问互联网的调用，都卡在坏掉的那一跳上
Every call to the internet stalls at the dead hop.

89
00:05:37,498 --> 00:05:40,701
但数据库的数据包仍然匹配 local 路由
But the database packet still matches the local route,

90
00:05:40,701 --> 00:05:43,429
负载均衡器也仍然连得到任务
and the load balancer still reaches the tasks.

91
00:05:43,749 --> 00:05:45,349
这就是第一个告警
That is the first alarm.

92
00:05:45,533 --> 00:05:46,955
第一道题
First question.

93
00:05:47,005 --> 00:05:52,470
私有子网里的一个 worker，启动时从公开网站下载模型权重
A worker in a private subnet downloads model weights from a public website at startup,

94
00:05:52,470 --> 00:05:55,965
而互联网上谁都不能主动连接它
and nobody on the internet may open a connection to it.

95
00:05:56,285 --> 00:05:58,141
它的默认路由应该指向哪里？
Where should its default route point?

96
00:05:58,461 --> 00:06:00,061
想停一下的话，就在这里暂停
Pause here if you want.

97
00:06:10,066 --> 00:06:13,634
选 C。NAT 把这个 worker 的请求带出去
C. NAT carries the worker's request out,

98
00:06:13,634 --> 00:06:17,319
把回复映射回来，并拒绝不请自来的连接
maps the reply back, and refuses uninvited connections.

99
00:06:17,639 --> 00:06:22,815
A，Internet Gateway，也能下载，但它让子网变成公有的
A, the Internet Gateway, would download too, but it makes the subnet public,

100
00:06:22,815 --> 00:06:26,152
多了一条直接进来的路，只靠防火墙规则把守
a direct path in, guarded only by firewall rules.

101
00:06:26,400 --> 00:06:30,481
B 不对：local 路由只覆盖 VPC 自己的地址块
B fails: the local route covers only the VPC's own block,

102
00:06:30,481 --> 00:06:32,629
而那个网站在外面
and the website is outside it.

103
00:06:32,949 --> 00:06:37,045
D 不对：负载均衡器是把请求带进来，交给它的目标
D fails: a load balancer brings requests in to its targets.

104
00:06:37,365 --> 00:06:38,965
它不是出去的路
It is not a way out.

105
00:06:39,650 --> 00:06:44,258
题目里出现私有子网，就想：默认路由指向 NAT
If the question says private subnet, think: the default route goes to NAT.

106
00:06:44,578 --> 00:06:47,437
NAT 只转发从里面发起的连接
NAT only carries connections that start inside.

107
00:06:47,757 --> 00:06:50,469
而如果 NAT 挂了，互联网调用会失败
And if NAT is down, internet calls fail,

108
00:06:50,469 --> 00:06:54,604
VPC 内部的流量，比如数据库，照样能用
while traffic inside the VPC, like the database, still works.

109
00:06:56,750 --> 00:06:59,331
现在看第二个告警，那个失败的按钮
Now the second alarm, the failing button.

110
00:06:59,651 --> 00:07:01,486
加载一个页面要跑两趟
Loading a page is two trips.

111
00:07:01,806 --> 00:07:07,630
先是浏览器从静态托管下载 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript
First the browser downloads HTML, CSS and JavaScript from a static host.

112
00:07:07,950 --> 00:07:12,793
然后这段 JavaScript 在访客自己的机器上运行，并调用 API
Then that JavaScript runs on the visitor's own machine, and calls the API.

113
00:07:13,033 --> 00:07:15,614
所以，浏览器在 VPC 外面
So the browser lives outside the VPC.

114
00:07:15,934 --> 00:07:17,789
静态文件从不进入 VPC
Static files never enter it,

115
00:07:17,789 --> 00:07:22,889
而每个 API 请求都必须从大门进来，也就是负载均衡器
and every API request must come in through the front door, the load balancer.

116
00:07:23,133 --> 00:07:24,576
再看课程的应用
Now the course app.

117
00:07:24,626 --> 00:07:25,865
在开发环境里
In development,

118
00:07:25,865 --> 00:07:31,236
前端从 next public base API URL 读取 API 地址
the frontend takes its API address from NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_API_URL,

119
00:07:31,236 --> 00:07:34,376
而这个变量写的是 localhost:9000
and that variable says localhost:9000.

120
00:07:34,696 --> 00:07:38,856
在开发者的笔记本上，那正是 API 运行的地方
On the developer's laptop, that was exactly where the API ran.

121
00:07:39,100 --> 00:07:43,175
把它发给访客，localhost 就成了访客自己的笔记本
Ship that to a visitor, and localhost means the visitor's laptop.

122
00:07:43,495 --> 00:07:46,161
那里没有东西在监听，所以请求失败了
Nothing listens there, so the request fails.

123
00:07:46,481 --> 00:07:48,103
这就是第二个告警
That is the second alarm.

124
00:07:48,350 --> 00:07:54,510
换成私有地址 10.0.2.5，请求永远到不了 VPC
Swap in the private address, 10.0.2.5, and the request never reaches the VPC:

125
00:07:54,510 --> 00:07:59,870
这个地址只在访客自己的网络里才有意义
that address means something only inside the visitor's own network.

126
00:08:00,190 --> 00:08:05,609
用公网的 HTTPS 域名就行：DNS，负载均衡器，再到一个任务
The public HTTPS name works: DNS, the load balancer, then a task.

127
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:09,331
生产环境的配置文件里只写了 /api
The production file says just /api.

128
00:08:09,651 --> 00:08:14,337
相对路径会回到提供这个页面的那台主机。这行得通的前提是
A relative path goes back to the host that served the page. That works

129
00:08:14,337 --> 00:08:21,088
一个公网大门同时提供页面和 API，也就是课上的布局 B
when one public front door serves both the page and the API, the lecture's layout B,

130
00:08:21,088 --> 00:08:23,283
并把 /api 路由到 FastAPI
and routes /api to FastAPI.

131
00:08:23,517 --> 00:08:26,061
课件第 24 页把这条规则写了两遍
Slide 24 writes that rule twice,

132
00:08:26,061 --> 00:08:30,194
一条 Nginx 的 proxy pass，或者一条负载均衡器的路径规则
as an Nginx proxy_pass or a load balancer path rule.

133
00:08:30,514 --> 00:08:35,570
要是用单独的静态托管，代码就必须写明公网 API 地址
With a separate static host, the code must name the public API address instead.

134
00:08:35,817 --> 00:08:41,278
注意私有地址在哪里：在代理的配置里，在 VPC 里面
Notice where the private address lives: in the proxy's config, inside the VPC.

135
00:08:41,598 --> 00:08:43,198
绝不出现在浏览器代码里
Never in browser code.

136
00:08:43,350 --> 00:08:44,751
再说两点
Two more facts.

137
00:08:44,801 --> 00:08:49,621
所有 next public 变量都会在构建时编译进 JavaScript
NEXT_PUBLIC_ variables are compiled into the JavaScript at build time,

138
00:08:49,621 --> 00:08:54,166
所以每个访客都会下载它们：本来就是公开的，绝不是密钥
so every visitor downloads them: public by design, never a secret.

139
00:08:54,486 --> 00:08:59,883
而且 NAT 在这里帮不上忙：它只转发从 VPC 里面发起的流量
And NAT does not help here: it only carries traffic that starts inside the VPC.

140
00:09:00,133 --> 00:09:05,552
题目里出现在浏览器里运行的代码，就想：它在 VPC 外面
If the question says code that runs in the browser, think: it is outside the VPC.

141
00:09:05,872 --> 00:09:08,425
调用公网的 HTTPS endpoint
Call the public HTTPS endpoint,

142
00:09:08,425 --> 00:09:11,226
绝不用 localhost 或 10 开头的地址
never localhost or a 10.x address.

143
00:09:11,546 --> 00:09:13,275
NAT 对入站没有帮助
NAT does not help inbound.

144
00:09:15,417 --> 00:09:18,425
现在看那个悄无声息的隐患：image 里的密钥
Now the quiet problem, the key inside the image.

145
00:09:18,745 --> 00:09:20,644
先看一次发布应该怎么做
First, how a release should work.

146
00:09:20,964 --> 00:09:24,110
把 image 构建一次，打上版本 tag 再 push
Build the image once, push it with a version tag,

147
00:09:24,110 --> 00:09:27,065
每次部署都 pull 这个确切的版本
and every deployment pulls that exact version.

148
00:09:27,385 --> 00:09:28,985
不重新构建
No rebuild.

149
00:09:29,384 --> 00:09:31,112
这个 image 是不可变的
The image is immutable.

150
00:09:31,432 --> 00:09:36,808
它从开发环境到预发环境再到生产环境，digest 从不改变
It moves from development to staging to production, and its digest never changes.

151
00:09:37,128 --> 00:09:42,060
不同的是 container 启动时插进去的运行时的值
What differs is the runtime values plugged in when the container starts:

152
00:09:42,060 --> 00:09:45,554
开发环境里 log level 是 debug，生产环境里是 info
LOG_LEVEL=debug in development, info in production.

153
00:09:45,800 --> 00:09:47,656
密钥也遵循同样的规则
Secrets follow the same rule.

154
00:09:47,976 --> 00:09:53,949
密钥管理服务在启动时交付密钥，只交给获得授权的工作负载
A secret manager delivers the key at startup, only to the workload that is authorized for it.

155
00:09:54,269 --> 00:09:58,878
绝不要把密钥放进源代码、container image 或 Git
Never place secrets in source code, in container images, or in Git.

156
00:09:59,117 --> 00:10:01,613
课程已经做了笔记本上的版本
The course already does the laptop version.

157
00:10:01,933 --> 00:10:05,622
运行脚本把 secrets 目录挂载到 /secrets
The run script mounts the secrets folder at /secrets,

158
00:10:05,622 --> 00:10:08,477
再把 Google Application Credentials
and points GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS

159
00:10:08,477 --> 00:10:11,192
指向 container 里密钥的路径
at the key's path inside the container.

160
00:10:11,434 --> 00:10:16,362
项目和 ChromaDB 的 host 也作为环境变量传进来
The project and the ChromaDB host arrive as environment variables too.

161
00:10:16,682 --> 00:10:20,031
应用在启动时用 os.environ 读取它们
The app reads them with os.environ when it starts.

162
00:10:20,300 --> 00:10:24,439
README 说了原因：我们不希望任何安全信息进入 Git
The README says why: we do not want any secure information in Git.

163
00:10:24,759 --> 00:10:28,258
密钥放在 repo 旁边，绝不放在里面
The key lives next to the repository, never inside it.

164
00:10:28,500 --> 00:10:29,986
再看错误的做法
Now the wrong way.

165
00:10:30,036 --> 00:10:34,281
把密钥打进 image，任何能 pull 这个 image 的人都能读到它
Bake the key into the image, and anyone who can pull the image can read it.

166
00:10:34,601 --> 00:10:38,639
轮换密钥就意味着重新构建，而每个环境各一个 image
Rotating it means a rebuild, and per environment images mean

167
00:10:38,639 --> 00:10:41,130
就意味着你测试过的不是你交付的
what you tested is not what you ship.

168
00:10:41,367 --> 00:10:42,874
第二道题
Second question.

169
00:10:42,924 --> 00:10:45,922
一个队友把 API 密钥写进 Dockerfile
A teammate bakes an API key into the Dockerfile

170
00:10:45,922 --> 00:10:49,239
再把 image push 到团队的私有 registry
and pushes the image to the team's private registry.

171
00:10:49,559 --> 00:10:51,159
哪个说法是对的？
Which statement is true?

172
00:10:51,330 --> 00:10:52,930
想停一下的话，就在这里暂停
Pause here if you want.

173
00:11:02,934 --> 00:11:08,285
选 D。这个 image 的配置和层，任何 pull 它的人都能读到
D. The image's settings and layers are readable by anyone who pulls it,

174
00:11:08,285 --> 00:11:10,593
而换密钥就意味着重新构建
and changing the key means a rebuild.

175
00:11:10,913 --> 00:11:15,480
A，私有 registry，能访问它的仍然是一长串的人和机器
A, the private registry, is still a long list of people and machines,

176
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:17,995
而且 image 会复制到每台主机上
and the image is copied to every host.

177
00:11:18,234 --> 00:11:21,024
B 不对：密钥写在 Dockerfile 里
B fails: the key is written in the Dockerfile,

178
00:11:21,024 --> 00:11:23,269
而 Dockerfile 在 Git 里，也在 image 里
which is in Git, and in the image.

179
00:11:23,589 --> 00:11:25,957
忽略另一个文件，什么也改变不了
Ignoring a different file changes nothing.

180
00:11:26,277 --> 00:11:28,804
C 也不对：开发环境的 image 会泄露
C fails too: development images leak,

181
00:11:28,804 --> 00:11:31,332
而分开的 image 违背了构建一次
and separate images break build once.

182
00:11:32,167 --> 00:11:35,634
题目问怎么把 image 发到生产环境
If a question asks how to move an image to production,

183
00:11:35,634 --> 00:11:38,332
就想：同一个 image，原样晋级
think: the same image, promoted unchanged.

184
00:11:38,652 --> 00:11:43,026
各环境的值和获得授权的密钥，在启动时注入
Environment values and authorized secrets are injected at startup.

185
00:11:43,346 --> 00:11:46,738
绝不要按环境重新构建，也绝不要打进密钥
Never rebuild per environment, and never bake a secret.

186
00:11:48,883 --> 00:11:50,483
现在看第三个告警
Now the third alarm.

187
00:11:50,611 --> 00:11:54,264
自动扩缩器测量一个信号，比如 CPU 使用率
An autoscaler measures a signal, like processor use,

188
00:11:54,264 --> 00:11:58,198
再套用一个带目标值、最小值和最大值的策略
applies a policy with a target, a minimum and a maximum,

189
00:11:58,198 --> 00:12:00,446
然后请求那么多个副本
and asks for that many replicas.

190
00:12:00,766 --> 00:12:03,347
但下游的限制仍然约束着结果
But downstream limits still bound the result.

191
00:12:03,583 --> 00:12:07,572
数据库只接受固定数量的连接，这里是 100 个
The database accepts a fixed number of connections, here 100.

192
00:12:07,892 --> 00:12:12,223
其他客户端已经占了一些：一个管理控制台，一个批处理任务
Other clients already hold some: an admin console, a batch job.

193
00:12:12,466 --> 00:12:14,962
每个副本都开自己的连接
Each replica opens its own connections.

194
00:12:15,282 --> 00:12:16,633
在课程的应用里
In the course app,

195
00:12:16,633 --> 00:12:21,021
每个 API 进程在导入时都创建自己的数据库客户端
every API process creates its own database client at import.

196
00:12:21,341 --> 00:12:25,501
这个客户端是 ChromaDB，在这里就把它当作连接池
That client is ChromaDB, standing in here for a connection pool.

197
00:12:25,750 --> 00:12:27,733
自动扩缩器不断加副本
The autoscaler adds replicas,

198
00:12:27,733 --> 00:12:32,107
每个都把自己的连接池插进空闲插槽，直到插槽用完
each plugging its pool into free slots, until the slots run out.

199
00:12:32,427 --> 00:12:36,054
下一个副本连不上，尽管它的 CPU 闲着
The next replica cannot connect, though its processor is idle.

200
00:12:36,300 --> 00:12:38,156
所以，直接从图上读出规则
So read the rule off the picture.

201
00:12:38,476 --> 00:12:42,487
100 个插槽，减去其他客户端的 10 个，剩下 90 个
100 slots, minus 10 for the other clients, leaves 90.

202
00:12:42,807 --> 00:12:45,985
除以每个副本的 20：得 4.5
Divide by 20 per replica: 4.5.

203
00:12:46,305 --> 00:12:50,237
一个副本不能只开半个连接池，所以向下取整到 4
A replica cannot open half a pool, so round down to 4,

204
00:12:50,237 --> 00:12:53,004
再把 4 设成自动扩缩器的最大值
and set 4 as the autoscaler's maximum.

205
00:12:53,250 --> 00:12:55,627
要再往上加，就加一个连接池代理
To go higher, add a connection pooler

206
00:12:55,627 --> 00:12:58,903
或者把每个连接池调小，或者买更大的数据库规格
or shrink each pool, or buy a bigger database tier.

207
00:12:59,223 --> 00:13:01,655
只调高最大值没有用
Raising the maximum alone does not help.

208
00:13:01,900 --> 00:13:03,322
第三道题
Third question.

209
00:13:03,372 --> 00:13:07,601
每个副本开 15 个连接，其他客户端占了 30 个
Each replica opens 15 connections, other clients hold 30,

210
00:13:07,601 --> 00:13:10,049
高峰时你需要 10 个副本
and at peak you need 10 replicas.

211
00:13:10,369 --> 00:13:12,972
能用的最小数据库规格是哪一个？
Which is the smallest database tier that works?

212
00:13:13,292 --> 00:13:14,892
想停一下的话，就在这里暂停
Pause here if you want.

213
00:13:24,900 --> 00:13:26,500
选 B，200
B, 200.

214
00:13:26,564 --> 00:13:31,748
十个 15 的连接池就是 150，加上其他的 30 个：180
Ten pools of 15 make 150, plus 30 others: 180.

215
00:13:32,068 --> 00:13:33,753
200 装得下
That fits under 200.

216
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:38,203
A，150，装得下连接池，却忘了其他客户端
A, 150, holds the pools but forgets the other clients.

217
00:13:38,523 --> 00:13:42,405
C，250，能用，但花了不必要的钱
C, 250, works, but costs more than it needs to.

218
00:13:42,725 --> 00:13:47,674
D：更高的最大值不会增加连接，所以多出来的副本会失败
D: a higher maximum adds no connections, so the extra replicas fail.

219
00:13:48,516 --> 00:13:52,289
题目给了数据库的连接数上限，就想
If the question gives a database connection limit, think:

220
00:13:52,289 --> 00:13:57,583
上限减去其他客户端，除以每个副本的连接数，向下取整
the limit minus other clients, divided by connections per replica, rounded down.

221
00:13:57,903 --> 00:14:02,959
再把它设成最大值，因为自动扩缩器不知道数据库的上限
And set it as the maximum, because the autoscaler does not know the database limit.

222
00:14:05,100 --> 00:14:07,852
最后一个机制，是数据放在哪里
The last mechanism is where the data lives.

223
00:14:08,172 --> 00:14:09,772
先分类
Classify it first.

224
00:14:09,943 --> 00:14:12,804
用户和订单，用外键关联
Users and orders, linked by foreign keys,

225
00:14:12,804 --> 00:14:17,409
存在全有或全无的事务里：这就是关系型
saved in transactions that are all or nothing: that is relational.

226
00:14:17,729 --> 00:14:21,420
找出最相似的五种奶酪：这就是向量检索
Find the five most similar cheeses: that is vector search.

227
00:14:21,667 --> 00:14:25,230
现在课程把 ChromaDB 单独跑在一个 container 里
Today the course runs ChromaDB as its own container.

228
00:14:25,550 --> 00:14:29,634
它是带元数据的向量库，由团队自己运维
It is a vector store with metadata, and the team operates it:

229
00:14:29,634 --> 00:14:32,312
补丁、备份和恢复都归你管
patches, backups and recovery are yours.

230
00:14:32,550 --> 00:14:37,222
课上比较了三个去处：虚拟机上的 ChromaDB
The lecture compares three homes: ChromaDB on a virtual machine,

231
00:14:37,222 --> 00:14:41,894
带 pgvector 的 PostgreSQL 服务，以及一个向量检索服务
a PostgreSQL service with pgvector, and a vector search service.

232
00:14:42,214 --> 00:14:44,006
向量卡片落进哪里都行
Vector chips land everywhere.

233
00:14:44,326 --> 00:14:48,763
外键和事务会从两个只做向量的去处弹开
Foreign keys and transactions bounce off the two vector-only homes.

234
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:50,941
你也可以跑两个数据库
You could run two databases.

235
00:14:51,261 --> 00:14:54,750
但那样它们就必须保持同步，总有一天，一个订单在一个库里存在
But then they must stay in sync, and one day an order exists

236
00:14:54,750 --> 00:14:57,832
而它的 embedding 在另一个库里却没有
in one while its embedding is missing from the other.

237
00:14:58,067 --> 00:15:02,035
只有带 pgvector 的 PostgreSQL 能接住所有卡片
Only PostgreSQL with pgvector takes every chip.

238
00:15:02,355 --> 00:15:07,293
向量列和关系型的列放在同一张表里
The vector column sits beside the relational columns in the same table,

239
00:15:07,293 --> 00:15:11,187
一条查询就能用 SQL 过滤，再按相似度排序
and one query filters with SQL and orders by similarity.

240
00:15:11,433 --> 00:15:14,804
托管的意思是，云厂商负责运行主机和打补丁
Managed means the provider runs the hosts and the patching.

241
00:15:15,124 --> 00:15:19,369
你的团队仍然负责 schema、查询、连接池管理和恢复演练
Your team still owns the schema, queries, pooling and restore tests.

242
00:15:19,689 --> 00:15:21,235
在 Google Cloud 上
On Google Cloud:

243
00:15:21,235 --> 00:15:24,809
就是 Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL，或者 AlloyDB
Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL, or AlloyDB.

244
00:15:25,050 --> 00:15:30,582
题目里出现一个托管数据库同时要满足关系型和向量的需求
If the question says relational and vector needs in one managed database,

245
00:15:30,582 --> 00:15:33,007
就想：PostgreSQL 加 pgvector
think: PostgreSQL plus pgvector.

246
00:15:33,327 --> 00:15:37,381
外键、事务和相似度检索，都在一个地方
Foreign keys, transactions and similarity search, in one place.

247
00:15:39,517 --> 00:15:41,117
小测的七条规则
Seven rules for the quiz.

248
00:15:41,437 --> 00:15:44,830
第一：localhost 是代码运行的那台机器
One: localhost is the machine the code runs on,

249
00:15:44,830 --> 00:15:47,069
10 开头的地址是私有的
and 10.x addresses are private.

250
00:15:47,389 --> 00:15:50,866
外界访问的是域名和负载均衡器
The public reaches a DNS name and a load balancer.

251
00:15:51,100 --> 00:15:56,668
第二：VPC 是一个切成子网的地址块，最具体的路由胜出
Two: a VPC is an address block cut into subnets, and the most specific route wins.

252
00:15:56,988 --> 00:16:00,231
第三：NAT 只转发从里面发起的连接
Three: NAT only carries connections that start inside.

253
00:16:00,551 --> 00:16:04,647
如果它坏了，互联网调用会失败，而数据库照样有回应
If it fails, internet calls fail, and the database still answers.

254
00:16:04,884 --> 00:16:10,879
第四：浏览器在 VPC 外面，所以它调用公网的 HTTPS endpoint
Four: the browser is outside the VPC, so it calls the public HTTPS endpoint.

255
00:16:11,199 --> 00:16:15,572
第五：只构建一个 image，在它启动时注入配置和密钥
Five: build one image, and inject settings and secrets when it starts.

256
00:16:15,817 --> 00:16:20,529
第六：最大副本数等于连接数上限减去其他客户端
Six: maximum replicas is the connection limit minus other clients,

257
00:16:20,529 --> 00:16:23,028
除以每个连接池的连接数，向下取整
divided by each pool, rounded down.

258
00:16:23,348 --> 00:16:26,930
第七：关系型加向量、一个托管数据库
Seven: relational plus vectors in one managed database means PostgreSQL with pgvector.

259
00:16:26,930 --> 00:16:30,025
就是 PostgreSQL 加 pgvector
Seven: relational plus vectors in one managed database means PostgreSQL with pgvector.

260
00:16:30,267 --> 00:16:33,083
这就是全貌，每个告警都修好了
Here is the whole picture, every alarm fixed.

261
00:16:33,403 --> 00:16:37,725
静态文件来自边缘节点，请求经过负载均衡器
Static files from the edge, requests through the load balancer,

262
00:16:37,725 --> 00:16:39,921
任务在私有应用子网里
tasks in the private app subnet,

263
00:16:39,921 --> 00:16:43,558
PostgreSQL 在数据子网里，NAT 负责往外的调用
PostgreSQL in the data subnet, and NAT for calls out.

264
00:16:43,800 --> 00:16:47,021
题目看起来难的时候，就照课上最后做的那样做
When a question looks hard, do what the lecture does last.

265
00:16:47,341 --> 00:16:48,941
先追踪请求
Trace the request first.

266
00:16:49,261 --> 00:16:50,861
小测加油
Good luck on the quiz.
